msgstr "Trennbalken twischen Titelbalken un Finsterinholt wiesen"

#: nitrogen/config/nitrogenconfigurationui.cpp:165
msgid ""
"When enabled, this option makes an horizontal separator appear between the "
"window title bar and the window contents."
msgstr ""
"Wenn anmaakt, gifft dat en kimmrecht Trennbalken twischen den Titelbalken un "
"den Finsterinholt."

#. i18n: file: ozone/config/oxygenconfig.ui:69
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, showStripes)
#. i18n: file: oxygen/config/oxygenconfig.ui:59
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, showStripes)
#: nitrogen/config/nitrogenconfigurationui.cpp:168 rc.cpp:56 rc.cpp:77
msgid "Show stripes next to the title"
msgstr "Striepen blang Titel wiesen"

#. i18n: file: ozone/config/oxygenconfig.ui:66
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, showStripes)
#. i18n: file: oxygen/config/oxygenconfig.ui:56
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, showStripes)
#: nitrogen/config/nitrogenconfigurationui.cpp:171 rc.cpp:53 rc.cpp:74
msgid ""
"When enabled, this option increases the visibility of the window titlebar by "
"showing stripes"
msgstr ""
"Wenn anmaakt, maakt disse Optschoon den Finster-Titelbalken mit Striepen "
"beter sichtbor."

#. i18n: file: ozone/config/oxygenconfig.ui:59
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, blendTitlebarColors)
#: nitrogen/config/nitrogenconfigurationui.cpp:174 rc.cpp:50
msgid "Blend title bar colors with window contents"
msgstr "Titelbalken-Klören na Finsterinholt mischen"

#: nitrogen/config/nitrogenconfigurationui.cpp:177
msgid ""
"When enabled, window colors are used in place of default title bar colors to "
"draw the decoration"
msgstr ""
"Wenn anmaakt, warrt de Finsterklören ansteed de Standard-Titelbalkenklören "
"för de Dekoratschoon bruukt."

#: nitrogen/config/nitrogenconfigurationui.cpp:180
msgid "Draw size grip widget in bottom-right corner of windows"
msgstr "Greep nerrn rechts binnen Finstern wiesen"

#: nitrogen/config/nitrogenconfigurationui.cpp:183
msgid ""
"When this option is enabled, a small triangular widget is drawn in bottom-"
"right corner of every window \n"
"that allow to resize the window. This the \"No Border\" border size is "
"selected."
msgstr ""
"Is dit anmaakt, hett elkeen Finster nerrn rechts en lütt Greep, mit den sik "
"de Finstergrött topassen lett. Dat is goot, wenn as Rahmendickde \"Keen "
"Rahmen\" utsöcht is."

#: nitrogen/config/nitrogenconfigurationui.cpp:190
msgid "Exceptions ..."
msgstr "Utnahmen..."

#: nitrogen/config/nitrogenconfigurationui.cpp:191
msgid "Raise a dialog to store blending type exceptions based on window title."
msgstr ""
"En Dialoog opropen, mit den sik Utnahmen för den Överblennentyp fastleggen "
"laat."

